# Meter config. Every value is optional; the commented value is the default
# the package uses when the variable is unset. No secrets: meter never
# takes keys or credentials, only names. Use `ws keys run -- <command>`
# for commands that need keys; meter itself needs none.
# METER_ANALYTICS_DATASET=mano_model_usage
# METER_R2_BUCKET=mano-meter
# METER_R2_PREFIX=meter/
